<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>天命人事 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%A9%E5%91%BD%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.154.5 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 23 Jan 2026 11:23:01 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%A9%E5%91%BD%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>天人寿夭篇第四</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-04/</link><pubDate>Fri, 14 Nov 2025 15:55:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-04/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>本文通过对话深入探讨了决定人寿命长短（“寿夭”）的因素，核心观点是：&lt;strong&gt;人的先天禀赋（“天”）决定了寿命的基础，但后天的自我修养（“人”）能对其产生决定性影响。&lt;/strong&gt; 即“寿夭定于天，挽回天命者人也”。</description></item><item><title>回天生育篇第三</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-03/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Nov 2025 14:15:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-03/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>本文通过雷公与岐伯（托名黄帝的医学家，此处代表作者观点）的对话，阐述了中医对于生育问题的核心观点：&lt;strong&gt;生育能力一半由先天“天命”决定，一半由后天“人事”决定。&lt;/strong&gt; 虽然“天命”不可更改，但通过尽“人事”——即针对性的治疗和调理，可以改变不孕的状况，实现“回天”（挽回天命）之效。文章最后特别强调了夫妇“德行”的重要性。</description></item></channel></rss>